        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenchanïn ECHOTYON, “Ikïr kegh mesoghchï pïchï kïnyorï köromnyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrkegh kïkïrur, moterchinanye sowutkökwa akï kirkegh kïpelwanïn amörostin anta ipkanïn ropöwo pagh, motokanye kokay. Wölo owongan chane ompö ngot nko kömöy nko sömew.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay olenchan Echotyon TORORÖT, “Kölö ne nya we ECHOTYON Kimuktoghin! Rose lö kömwochï werkoy pïchete lö, ‘Metwokwanye ngot anta kömöy ompöwölo keyomiswecha ECHOTYON kalya ompö korencha.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kuyokwanïn ECHOTYON lö, “Kamwa werkoyichoni putintön ompö kaynenyan. Moyonwanye chane kïpka kïmwa kïgh, amongölonchanye chane nyonikïny. Kïlenyona, pkono ngalechoni mwoghöy werkoy kinonutkökwa opïn akï ngorat nyo le kwïle nyo puryö tösunöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona omwowunyi ante ECHOTYON kïgh ompö werkoy cho ngoröy ngal ompö kaynenyan kïrkegh melö kyoyonwan chane kïmwochï pich lö metwokwanye ngot nko kömöy ompö korenkwa. Owongan chane ompö ngot nko kömöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonyot lenyoni tïkwïl pïchoni kïmwochï werkoyichoni ngalechoni. Kichoghchini porwöyikwa ortïna kanasyanta Yerusalem akï puryö chi nyo tïpöy chane. Sitöt nyoni nyo nyoru chane löwïr, koru nko monïnge cho le tipïn nko cho le wor. Oghan lenyoni akwompö ngokï cho kigh chane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
